{"id":"ee9a93363bcae359","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-id1.md","title":"Theory ID₁","display":"df-id1 — Theory ID₁","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-id1","aliases":["18-df-id1","18-df-056"],"display":"df-id1 — Theory ID₁","depends_on":["[[18-df-nt]]","[[18-df-inductive-definition-axioms]]","[[18-df-formula]]","[[18-df-free-variable]]","[[18-df-substitution-formula]]","[[18-df-first-order-calculus]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Definition 9.1.1","source_printed_pages":"157–158","source_pdf_pages":"167–168","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-id1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-id1</span><span>18-df-056</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-id1 — Theory ID₁"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c5e56070c342728\" href=\"?note=0c5e56070c342728\" title=\"18-df-nt\">18-df-nt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd63116e7f220f4d\" href=\"?note=fd63116e7f220f4d\" title=\"18-df-inductive-definition-axioms\">18-df-inductive-definition-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6572d061e706d93\" href=\"?note=d6572d061e706d93\" title=\"18-df-substitution-formula\">18-df-substitution-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"592fd98020c21e43\" href=\"?note=592fd98020c21e43\" title=\"18-df-first-order-calculus\">18-df-first-order-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 9.1.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"157–158"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"167–168"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0c5e56070c342728\" href=\"?note=0c5e56070c342728\" title=\"18-df-nt\">18-df-nt</a> 的原始递归算术语言与无归纳算术公理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L}(n,A,P_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L}(n,A,P_A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^*\">\\(\\forall^*\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fd63116e7f220f4d\" href=\"?note=fd63116e7f220f4d\" title=\"18-df-inductive-definition-axioms\">18-df-inductive-definition-axioms</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span> 固定一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元占位关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{(n)}\">\\(X^{(n)}\\)</span>，它们与算术符号、参数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(X_i)\">\\(r(X_i)\\)</span> 和新归纳谓词均不交；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fd63116e7f220f4d\" href=\"?note=fd63116e7f220f4d\" title=\"18-df-inductive-definition-axioms\">18-df-inductive-definition-axioms</a> 的正公式与替换按此占位符实例化。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\)</span> 对应相互不同且全新的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元谓词符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{n,A}\">\\(P_{n,A}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec X=(X_1,\\ldots,X_k)\\in\\mathcal X^k\">\\(\\vec X=(X_1,\\ldots,X_k)\\in\\mathcal X^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le k&lt;\\omega\">\\(1\\le k&lt;\\omega\\)</span>，各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i\">\\(X_i\\)</span> 互异；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(X_i)\">\\(r(X_i)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0c5e56070c342728\" href=\"?note=0c5e56070c342728\" title=\"18-df-nt\">18-df-nt</a> 中对应的全新一元关系符号，均不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a> 的一阶公式语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[t/x]\">\\(G[t/x]\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d6572d061e706d93\" href=\"?note=d6572d061e706d93\" title=\"18-df-substitution-formula\">18-df-substitution-formula</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^*\">\\(\\forall^*\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a> 的闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=j_1(\\mathsf S)\">\\(S=j_1(\\mathsf S)\\)</span> 是后继符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=\\mathfrak z\">\\(0=\\mathfrak z\\)</span> 是数零常元。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash F\">\\(T\\vdash F\\)</span> 在这些语言中使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"592fd98020c21e43\" href=\"?note=592fd98020c21e43\" title=\"18-df-first-order-calculus\">18-df-first-order-calculus</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosFml}\">\\(\\mathrm{PosFml}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eql}\">\\(\\mathrm{Eql}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 是下式引入的语法索引集与公理模式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eql}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{\\forall^*(s=t\\to(G[s/x]\\to G[t/x]))\n\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L},\\\nG\\in\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Eql}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{\\forall^*(s=t\\to(G[s/x]\\to G[t/x]))\n\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L},\\\nG\\in\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PosFml}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\n\\{(n,A)\\mid A\\in\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}\\land\\mathrm{free}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}&amp;:=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\n\\{P_{n,A}\\mid(n,A)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}(\\mathcal L)&amp;:=\n\\left\\{\\forall^*\\!\\left(\n[G[0/x]\\land\\forall x\\,(G\\to G[Sx/x])]\n\\to\\forall x\\,G\\right)\n\\ \\middle|\\ G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ID}_1&amp;:=\n\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\mathrm{Eql}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}})\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}})\n\\cup\\bigcup_{(n,A)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}}\n\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}(n,A,P_{n,A}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PosFml}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\n\\{(n,A)\\mid A\\in\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}\\land\\mathrm{free}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}&amp;:=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\n\\{P_{n,A}\\mid(n,A)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}(\\mathcal L)&amp;:=\n\\left\\{\\forall^*\\!\\left(\n[G[0/x]\\land\\forall x\\,(G\\to G[Sx/x])]\n\\to\\forall x\\,G\\right)\n\\ \\middle|\\ G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ID}_1&amp;:=\n\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\mathrm{Eql}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}})\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}})\n\\cup\\bigcup_{(n,A)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}}\n\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}(n,A,P_{n,A}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X)&amp;:=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}\\cup\\{r(X_1),\\ldots,r(X_k)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ID}_1(\\vec X)&amp;:=\n\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\mathrm{Eql}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X))\n\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X))\n\\cup\\bigcup_{(n,A)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}}\n\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X)}(n,A,P_{n,A}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X)&amp;:=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}\\cup\\{r(X_1),\\ldots,r(X_k)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ID}_1(\\vec X)&amp;:=\n\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\mathrm{Eql}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X))\n\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X))\n\\cup\\bigcup_{(n,A)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}}\n\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X)}(n,A,P_{n,A}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 9.1.1。新增谓词的语言先由不含这些谓词的算术算子公式确定，随后取该扩展语言的全部归纳和最小性模式，并补充扩展语言等词替换实例。单纯把 PA 的旧语言归纳公理与两条固定公式相并，不能得到原书 ID<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_1\">\\(_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原书还区分允许自由集合参数的保守扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1(\\vec X)\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1(\\vec X)\\)</span> 与无集合参数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span>（p.158）。上式给出该扩展，其中新增谓词参数不带定义公理，但归纳与最小性模式在扩展语言中实例化；原始递归基本公理仍取同一组。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-nt","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e56070c342728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-nt]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-inductive-definition-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"fd63116e7f220f4d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-inductive-definition-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d6572d061e706d93","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-first-order-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"592fd98020c21e43","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-first-order-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-nt","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e56070c342728","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 与 $\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 是 [[18-df-nt]] 的原始递归算术语言与无归纳算术公理。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-inductive-definition-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"fd63116e7f220f4d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}$、$\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L}(n,A,P_A)$、$\\forall^*$ 按 [[18-df-inductive-definition-axioms]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-inductive-definition-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"fd63116e7f220f4d","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对每个 $n\\ge1$ 固定一个 $n$ 元占位关系符号 $X^{(n)}$，它们与算术符号、参数符号 $r(X_i)$ 和新归纳谓词均不交；[[18-df-inductive-definition-axioms]] 的正公式与替换按此占位符实例化。每个 $n\\ge1$、$A\\in\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}$ 且 $\\mathrm{free}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}$ 对应相互不同且全新的 $n$ 元谓词符号 $P_{n,A}$。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-nt","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e56070c342728","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vec X=(X_1,\\ldots,X_k)\\in\\mathcal X^k$，$1\\le k<\\omega$，各 $X_i$ 互异；$r(X_i)$ 是 [[18-df-nt]] 中对应的全新一元关系符号，均不属于 $\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}$。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L)$ 是 [[18-df-formula]] 的一阶公式语法；$G[t/x]$ 使用 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]，$\\forall^*$ 使用 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的闭包。$S=j_1(\\mathsf S)$ 是后继符号，$0=\\mathfrak z$ 是数零常元。$T\\vdash F$ 在这些语言中使用 [[18-df-first-order-calculus]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d6572d061e706d93","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L)$ 是 [[18-df-formula]] 的一阶公式语法；$G[t/x]$ 使用 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]，$\\forall^*$ 使用 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的闭包。$S=j_1(\\mathsf S)$ 是后继符号，$0=\\mathfrak z$ 是数零常元。$T\\vdash F$ 在这些语言中使用 [[18-df-first-order-calculus]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L)$ 是 [[18-df-formula]] 的一阶公式语法；$G[t/x]$ 使用 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]，$\\forall^*$ 使用 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的闭包。$S=j_1(\\mathsf S)$ 是后继符号，$0=\\mathfrak z$ 是数零常元。$T\\vdash F$ 在这些语言中使用 [[18-df-first-order-calculus]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-first-order-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"592fd98020c21e43","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L)$ 是 [[18-df-formula]] 的一阶公式语法；$G[t/x]$ 使用 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]，$\\forall^*$ 使用 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的闭包。$S=j_1(\\mathsf S)$ 是后继符号，$0=\\mathfrak z$ 是数零常元。$T\\vdash F$ 在这些语言中使用 [[18-df-first-order-calculus]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L}(n,A,P_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall^*","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"X^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"r(X_i)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"P_{n,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec X=(X_1,\\ldots,X_k)\\in\\mathcal X^k","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le k<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X_i","display":false},{"tex":"r(X_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"G[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall^*","display":false},{"tex":"S=j_1(\\mathsf S)","display":false},{"tex":"0=\\mathfrak z","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PosFml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eql}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eql}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{\\forall^*(s=t\\to(G[s/x]\\to G[t/x]))\n\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L},\\\nG\\in\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PosFml}&:=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\n\\{(n,A)\\mid A\\in\\mathcal P_{X^{(n)},n}\\land\\mathrm{free}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}&:=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\n\\{P_{n,A}\\mid(n,A)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}(\\mathcal L)&:=\n\\left\\{\\forall^*\\!\\left(\n[G[0/x]\\land\\forall x\\,(G\\to G[Sx/x])]\n\\to\\forall x\\,G\\right)\n\\ \\middle|\\ G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ID}_1&:=\n\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\mathrm{Eql}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}})\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}})\n\\cup\\bigcup_{(n,A)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}}\n\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}}(n,A,P_{n,A}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X)&:=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}\\cup\\{r(X_1),\\ldots,r(X_k)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ID}_1(\\vec X)&:=\n\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\mathrm{Eql}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X))\n\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X))\n\\cup\\bigcup_{(n,A)\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}}\n\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X)}(n,A,P_{n,A}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1(\\vec X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false}],"bytes":4337,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-id1]]"},{"id":"7d64cebf443a3f29","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$1\\le k<\\omega$，$\\vec X=\\langle X_1,\\ldots,X_k\\rangle$ 为互异的自由一元集合参数。$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X),\\mathrm{ID}_1(\\vec X)$ 见 [[18-df-id1]]；$\\mathcal L_\\in,\\mathrm{KP}_\\omega$ 见 [[18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]。$\\mathcal D(\\vec X),\\iota_E,\\iota_\\in$ 是 [[18-df-arithmetic-realization]] 的明确语法域与实现；一阶显示符号 $X_i$ 使用上游的 $r(X_i)$ 约定。"},{"id":"aa6b01d732017d3a","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$1\\le k<\\omega$，$\\vec X=\\langle X_1,\\ldots,X_k\\rangle$，参数与呈示 $\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X},\\mathfrak K$ 按 [[18-thm-id1-kp-ordinal]]。$L_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{PA}^{-},\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 见 [[18-df-peano-arithmetic]]；$\\mathrm{Eql}$ 见 [[18-df-id1]]。$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 在 PA 的 $0,1,+,\\cdot$ 语言中展开，不把原始递归语言的独立后继符号加入 PA。"},{"id":"6b282f1972a35fb5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$1\\le k<\\omega$，$\\vec X=\\langle X_1,\\ldots,X_k\\rangle$ 为互异的自由一元集合参数。$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X),\\mathrm{ID}_1(\\vec X)$ 见 [[18-df-id1]]；$\\mathcal L_\\in,\\mathrm{KP}_\\omega$ 见 [[18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]。$\\mathcal D(\\vec X),\\iota_E,\\iota_\\in$ 是 [[18-df-arithmetic-realization]] 的明确语法域与实现；一阶显示符号 $X_i$ 使用上游的 $r(X_i)$ 约定。"},{"id":"9a09ccaf5288aab0","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$1\\le k<\\omega$，$\\vec X=\\langle X_1,\\ldots,X_k\\rangle$，参数与呈示 $\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X},\\mathfrak K$ 按 [[18-thm-id1-kp-ordinal]]。$L_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{PA}^{-},\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 见 [[18-df-peano-arithmetic]]；$\\mathrm{Eql}$ 见 [[18-df-id1]]。$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 在 PA 的 $0,1,+,\\cdot$ 语言中展开，不把原始递归语言的独立后继符号加入 PA。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-id1]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-id1]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-id1|18-df-id1]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-id1|18-df-id1]]"}],"outgoing":["0c5e56070c342728","fd63116e7f220f4d","2718a8a11c383b33","0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","d6572d061e706d93","592fd98020c21e43"]}